  "118.2.7": "wa•karuku rikisu', atit, pahuks. Tirarah•kiwi a wi•tiks-",
  "118.2.9": "a tirah•tsaisiku atit a pahuks.",
  "118.2.10": "Ku•kur•rutsiks•taru ruksiri•witau tsahriks raku•ka•wihat",
  "118.2.11": "asku akar•raratau. Hawa ah•rukstah•ka•wariki arusa pit-",
  "118.2.13": "Wi•tuks•ta tawe•kuki wi•tuks•ta•waruksti. Tsahriks•pa-",
  "118.2.14": "kuhtu wi•tuks•paktiks.",
